# {{.ProjectName}}

A Go REST API built with Clean Architecture.

## Architecture

```bash
internal/
├── domain/           # Layer 1: Enterprise Business Rules (innermost)
│   ├── entity/       # Business entities - pure Go structs
│   ├── repository/   # Repository INTERFACES (ports)
│   ├── service/      # Domain service INTERFACES
│   └── valueobject/  # Value objects (Email, Money, etc.)
│
├── usecase/          # Layer 2: Application Business Rules
│   └── user/         # Use case implementation
│
├── adapter/          # Layer 3: Interface Adapters
│   ├── repository/   # Repository IMPLEMENTATIONS
│   ├── handler/      # HTTP/gRPC handlers
│   └── presenter/    # Response formatters
│
└── infrastructure/   # Layer 4: Frameworks & Drivers (outermost)
    ├── config/       # Configuration loading
    ├── database/     # Database connection
    ├── cache/        # Cache connection
    ├── server/       # Server bootstrap
    ├── logger/       # Logging setup
    └── di/           # Dependency injection
```

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Go 1.23+
  {{- if eq .Database "postgres"}}
- PostgreSQL 16+
  {{- end}}
  {{- if eq .Database "mysql"}}
- MySQL 8+
  {{- end}}
  {{- if .HasRedis}}
- Redis 7+
  {{- end}}
  {{- if .IncludeDocker}}
- Docker & Docker Compose
  {{- end}}

### Setup

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone {{.ModuleName}}
cd {{.ProjectName}}

# Copy environment variables
cp .env.example .env

# Install dependencies
go mod tidy
{{- if .IncludeDocker}}

# Start infrastructure (database, cache, etc.)
docker-compose up -d
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasDatabase}}

# Run migrations
make migrate-up
{{- end}}
{{- if .IncludeMake}}

# Run the server
make run
{{- else}}

# Run the server
go run ./cmd/api
{{- end}}
```

{{- if .HasHTTP}}

### API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint          | Description     |
| ------ | ----------------- | --------------- |
| POST   | /api/v1/users     | Create a user   |
| GET    | /api/v1/users/:id | Get user by ID  |
| PUT    | /api/v1/users/:id | Update a user   |
| DELETE | /api/v1/users/:id | Delete a user   |
| GET    | /api/v1/users     | List users      |
| GET    | /health           | Health check    |
| GET    | /ready            | Readiness check |

{{- end}}

