## Project Structure

The project follows Clean Architecture principles:

1. **Dependency Rule**: Source code dependencies point inward only
2. **Dependency Inversion**: High-level modules define interfaces; low-level modules implement them
3. **Separation of Concerns**: Each layer has a single, well-defined responsibility

